ady  doing a more than formidable job at that  what a time to be alive this episode has  been supported  by lambda gpu cloud if you're looking  for inexpensive  cloud gpus for ai check out lambda  gpu cloud they've recently launched  quadro rtx 6000  rtx 8000 and v100 instances  and hold on to your papers because  lambda gpu cloud can  cost less than half of aws and azure  plus they are the only cloud service  with 48 gigabyte  rdx 8000 join researchers at  organizations like apple  mit and caltech in using lambda cloud  instances  workstations or servers make sure to go  to lambdalabs.com  papers to sign up for one of their  amazing gpu instances today  our thanks to lambda for their  long-standing support and  for helping us make better videos for  you thanks for watching and for your  generous support and i'll see you  next time
 

